[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12067.83, "timestamp": "03:21:07", "text": "你好。所以，这就好比我们是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12069.75, "timestamp": "03:21:09", "text": "重新访问服务器。该活动有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12072.349, "timestamp": "03:21:12", "text": "完成的。这是，呃，这是SMP"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12077.03, "timestamp": "03:21:17", "text": "阿斯特拉蒂称之为毁灭。但这确实很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12080.07, "timestamp": "03:21:20", "text": "印度 YouTube 博主。我们当时就像在做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12084.469, "timestamp": "03:21:24", "text": "一个基于故事的SMP之类的东西，或者SMP。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12087.51, "timestamp": "03:21:27", "text": "但我什么时候给你过这个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12090.95, "timestamp": "03:21:30", "text": "我指的是枯萎玫瑰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12093.63, "timestamp": "03:21:33", "text": "而且是金色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12097.75, "timestamp": "03:21:37", "text": "是的。但我什么时候把光盘给你的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12111.15, "timestamp": "03:21:51", "text": "我的天哪。什么？什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12114.71, "timestamp": "03:21:54", "text": "这到底是怎么回事？看看神社"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12119.03, "timestamp": "03:21:59", "text": "可爱。好的，我会回来的。好的。"}]